sequenceDiagram
    participant MA as MainActivity
    participant PV as QuestionPreviewActivity
    participant ENG as QuestionEngine(独立实例)
    participant PV2 as QuestionProvider
    participant UI as QuestionUi

    MA->>PV: startActivity(Preview)
    PV->>ENG: create(ctx, pref)  // 与锁屏同工厂，独立 recent
    PV->>ENG: nextPreviewQuestion()
    ENG->>PV2: next(grade, random)  // 绕过 recent
    PV2-->>ENG: Question
    ENG-->>PV: Question
    PV->>UI: render(q, tvStem, tvHint, btnOption1..4)
    Note over PV: 选项点击仅高亮对错（家长参考），不解锁、不计数
    PV->>ENG: nextPreviewQuestion()  // 点"换一题"
    ENG-->>PV: 新 Question
    PV->>UI: render(...)

---

sequenceDiagram
    participant MA as MainActivity
    participant SAF as 系统文件选择器
    participant CBS as CustomBankStore
    participant BR as BankRepository
    participant REPO as files/custom_banks

    MA->>MA: 选 科目+年级（弹窗）
    MA->>SAF: ACTION_OPEN_DOCUMENT(*/*, application/json)
    SAF-->>MA: onActivityResult(uri)
    MA->>MA: 读 uri 文本 → json
    MA->>CBS: importBank(ctx, subject, grade, json)
    CBS->>CBS: org.json 校验(entries≥4, k/v非空)
    alt 校验通过
        CBS->>REPO: 写 <subject>_<grade>.json
        CBS-->>MA: true → Toast「已导入」
    else 校验失败
        CBS-->>MA: false → Toast「格式不正确」
    end
    Note over BR: 下次 load(subject,grade) 先查 L0 CustomBankStore，命中即用

---

sequenceDiagram
    participant LSA as LockScreenActivity
    participant PM as PrefManager
    participant MA2 as MainActivity

    LSA->>LSA: onOptionSelected(index)
    LSA->>LSA: correct = (index==q.correctIndex)
    LSA->>PM: recordAnswer(correct)  // total++; 命中则 correct++
    Note over LSA: 后续解锁/清零逻辑不变
    MA2->>PM: getAccuracyPercent()    // 设置页 updateStatus
    PM-->>MA2: -1(无数据) 或 百分比
    MA2->>MA2: tvAccuracy 显示「累计正确率 xx%」
